      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name} It seems there's been a long standing issue to add support for that, but it requires significant changes to core code so hasn't been implemented yet https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp/issues/4680\n\nyt-dlp maintainers said that using the safari user agent globally shouldn't cause any issues in the meantime, and seem open to the idea of adding an additional youtube:player_client specifically for the safari user agent in the meantime",
